  "body": "## Latest archival-head correction — release CI pending\n\nUser has ACCEPTED Phase6's eight restricted engineering requirements and conditionally authorized merge/baseline publication after the documentation/identity-only diff and successful CI gates. Independently reviewed implementation remains `3017a097b49ecdae68228ca9a417fcd03c313200`; the fixed-review lock below remains this exact SHA.\n\nCurrent documentation head: `a4d650d5d15e814600fde0bb6858fe97f14e5229`. C→this head is399 documentation/identity files only;83 source modules, tests, tools, workflows, locks, scanner rules and5016 protected files unchanged. Original archival head `e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee` run40087892421 Windows completed1567 tests without failures but failed its final pinned secret scan. All54 matches were independently stdlib-recomputed public research-configuration identity hashes, not credentials. This original CI remains FAILURE and its original logs/official artifact are retained.\n\nSeven verbatim reviewer attachments are now retained in the complete original sealed EVIDENCE.zip, directly readable external files and prior Git history. Their exact member names/bytes/hashes/locations are recorded in `docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/EXTERNAL_ORIGINALS.json`. Original reviewer REPORT/FINDINGS/manifest bytes are unchanged. No allowlist, scanner, code or test was weakened. This new archival head passed the unchanged pinned local scanner with positive/negative controls, plus static83-module/5016-file gate. It must pass a new full dual-OS CI and original-artifact validation before merge. Git-only readers need the explicitly indexed external originals for those seven attachments.\n\nNo merge/tag has occurred yet. Phase7 materials remain external design drafts until Phase6 release is verified. All Windows R2/formal-Test/financial-approval/historical-host/deployment/live restrictions remain. The older sections below are historical where superseded.\n\nAQRP_FIXED_REVIEW_SHA: 3017a097b49ecdae68228ca9a417fcd03c313200\n\n> 2026-10-24 最新用户决定：**Phase6八项受限工程范围已ACCEPTED**，已条件授权核实文档/身份元数据差异及CI通过后合并PR9并发布phase6-baseline /v0.6.0，旧标签不移动。当前 **RELEASE PENDING**，尚未执行合并或发布；CI门禁未完成时不提升状态。发布核实后仅授权Phase7 G1计划预审，不授权Phase7业务实现、部署、实盘、正式Test或金融批准，WI-R2及历史宿主延期边界保持。直接人工原话和时间记录随后归档在Phase6 publication/APPROVAL.json。\n\n以下是此前G2接收时的原状态记录；其中待用户验收/未获发布授权是其原时点历史，由上条最新人工决定更新，已审实现与归档SHA及所有原始证据不改。\n\nPhase6 八项受限工程范围（5 MVP / 3 Competition Ready）**G2 PASS / HUMAN ACCEPTANCE PENDING**。GPT Work独立复核仅覆盖上列已审实现，三项原发现均CLOSED — FIX VERIFIED，无新增阻断。**用户阶段验收、main合并、基线/标签发布及P7启动尚未授权**，本PR保持Draft。\n\n当前文档归档HEAD：`e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee`，与已审`3017a097b49ecdae68228ca9a417fcd03c313200`明确分列；不把归档HEAD或新的Actions运行自动视为独立G2通过。归档只含原始审查资料、当前状态及文档身份元数据：83业务模块、原测试、工具、工作流、core/UI锁、正确答案及5016保护文件全部未改。原实现身份JSON按已审字节保存在reviewed/；现行身份只刷新10份已变更文档的哈希，业务bundle及保护清单不变，未降低检查。详[身份差异说明](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee/docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/ARCHIVAL_IDENTITY_UPDATE.json)。\n\n本轮原件：[完整独立报告](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee/docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/received/REPORT.md)、[发现清单](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee/docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/received/FINDINGS.json)、[原收据](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee/docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/received/RECEIPT.json)、[开发接收处置](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee/docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/DEVELOPER_RESPONSE.md)、[发布前条件与权限](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee/docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/REVIEW_DISPOSITION.json)、[全部原件/外置工件索引](https://github.com/wwooyy429/Alpha-Quant-Research-Platform-AQRP-/blob/e0d8d79cecbb0f3d36ace7fa9fdc983c13b30bee/docs/audits/phase-6/g2-3017a09/EVIDENCE_INDEX.json)。旧eae807f BLOCKED、C3/C4原生退出失败、C5 WAL真实缺陷/环境拒绝、无效辅助执行和日志工件均保留，后来的通过不改写历史失败。\n\n独立关闭结果：\n- WORK-P6-G2-001 High：固定campaign全集/共同Holm定义、同数据原子共享预算、跨计划污染及失败取消不退独立核验通过。\n- WORK-P6-G2-002 Medium blocking：取消时重核物理账本/锚/文件集及完整财务projection，损坏按FAILED / COMMITTED_STATE_UNVERIFIED关闭；终态历史与公开INTEGRITY_ERROR分别保留。\n- WORK-P6-G2-003 Medium blocking：真实股票池选择驱动P1时点成员、实际P3及P5侧车；三池CLI/SDK canonical、主审TAIL4研究/CORE4全链核验通过。\n- DEV-P6-004 WAL并发准入、DEV-P6-002连接生命周期、DEV-P6-003六断点工程终止/恢复控制按主审范围关闭；DEV-P6-001维持此前独立关闭。**DEV-P6-003旧原生精确原因仍NOT VERIFIED**，不得将测试控制闭环写成原因已证明。\n\n固定实现的独立证据：主审新干净SDK **1567 passed /0 failed /0 errors /0 skipped**；主审核验Windows/Ubuntu官方原包各1567；原20+4回归、91数学、5112数值上下文、额外40真实进程通过。同进程runpy两条警告保留，不称零警告。主审亲自真实浏览器为两项股票池任务17 AX/4 JPEG；开发57主AX/27主截图及其余五入口/默认CAS/下载/重放证据经主审核验，不混称全部由主审重跑。\n\n官方已审CI run40079197702（head为已审3017a097b49ecdae68228ca9a417fcd03c313200）：\n- Windows原ZIP198336918字节，SHA256 `1a286a16bf55d9b76dc018efc793aa1f77838a26bf109dfb441638b5078572b8`。\n- Ubuntu原ZIP239459656字节，SHA256 `e8392f5dd2adb7953fd6e0e51cd2e28effc4da61a14feca8759ece504408242f`。\n- 两OS各265组/7278 current副本仅证明整子树字节一致，不证明原ACL/symlink身份。\n\n本轮独立封存原ZIP：`C:/Users/11638/AppData/Local/AQRP/reviews/p6-g2-recheck-3017a09-independent-20261024/EVIDENCE.zip`，**2981176853 bytes**，SHA256 `b71ef0c6413493c5cb0e4cc244dbe0436a0deb502da99f00112c5a44caa8aa0f`；manifest SHA256 `253af951aae9c9b99f344a9ebac94df22a8318ac0fdb272c19a44896d892b849`，348声明文件+manifest共349成员。开发方仅做接收：精确成员/长度/全部hash/CRC通过，344个清单内小型原件按字节复制入Git；4份大型原ZIP保留外置并按清单绑定。没有执行收到的审计脚本或自称新独立复核。行政原日志见reception/及外置`C:\\Users\\11638\\AppData\\Local\\Packages\\OpenAI.Codex_2p2nqsd0c76g0\\LocalCache\\Local\\AQRP\\runs\\p6-g2-pass-3017a09-20261024`。\n\n发布前还需：用户明确Phase6验收、单独合并/新基线/标签授权；核对当前归档差异及适用检查，授权合并后执行干净SDK/既定回归并核main/基线/新标签同一验收版本，旧标签不移动。P7另行授权，不自动启动。本归档提交的新Actions与已审实现的G2/CI分别记录，不转移通过结论。\n\nWI-R2-001/002及整体真实Windows隔离继续 **DEFERRED / NOT VERIFIED**；正式Test未运行、金融批准NONE、完整历史宿主限制保留，正式入口失败关闭。真实最终集成/权限验证方案另行授权。不启用账户、不改真实ACL、不部署、不实盘、不合并、不打标签、不运行正式Test、不授金融批准或进入P7。\n",
